Package: httpjet
Architecture: amd64 arm64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, adduser, systemd, util-linux (>= 2.38), openssl
Description: Rust HTTP server with LiteSpeed-compatible configuration
 httpjet serves HTTP with a dedicated unprivileged service account and reads
 LiteSpeed-compatible XML configuration. The default installation serves a
 static welcome page on ports 80 and 443 with a unique self-signed certificate.
 PHP, page caching and management listeners
 require explicit administrator configuration.

Package: httpjet-archive-keyring
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: public signing keys for the httpjet package archive
 This package supplies the public archive key used by the httpjet APT source.
 It can be upgraded independently of the server to support archive key rotation.
